{
 "html": "<section class=\"section_sv-included theme-light\" id=\"included\" data-frame=\"whats-included\" aria-labelledby=\"inc-h\"><span class=\"ab_frame-label\" data-frame-label=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">▢ whats-included</span><div class=\"ab_light-glow is-top\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"ab_light-glow is-bottom\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"ab_light-bg\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"padding-global\"><div class=\"container-large\"><div class=\"padding-section-medium\"><div class=\"ab_sec-h\"><div class=\"ab_section-head is-flush\"><div class=\"text-style-eyebrow\">/payload · <span data-sv=\"deliver-count\">6</span> deliverables</div><h2 class=\"heading-style-h2\" id=\"inc-h\" data-split=\"\">What’s <span class=\"t-outline\">included</span></h2></div><p class=\"ab_sec-h_lede text-size-lede\">Everything this mission ships with, planned and mocked up first, then built from the ground up.</p></div><div class=\"ab_bento_grid is-included\"><div class=\"ab_bento_cell\"><article class=\"ab_bento-card is-sv\" data-selectable=\"\" data-name=\"Card / item-01\"><div class=\"ab_sv_dl_n text-style-mono\"><span>Item 01</span><span class=\"ab_sv_dl_ck\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></div><div class=\"ab_sv_dl_ic\" data-sv-icon=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"ab_bento-card_copy\"><h3 class=\"ab_bento-card_title\" data-field=\"deliverable-1\">Deliverable</h3><p class=\"ab_bento-card_text\" data-field=\"deliverable-1-desc\">What it is.</p></div></article></div><div class=\"ab_bento_cell\"><article class=\"ab_bento-card is-sv\" data-selectable=\"\" data-name=\"Card / item-02\"><div class=\"ab_sv_dl_n text-style-mono\"><span>Item 02</span><span class=\"ab_sv_dl_ck\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></div><div class=\"ab_sv_dl_ic\" data-sv-icon=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"ab_bento-card_copy\"><h3 class=\"ab_bento-card_title\" data-field=\"deliverable-2\">Deliverable</h3><p class=\"ab_bento-card_text\" data-field=\"deliverable